{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🍦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかくなってきましたね。\nなので、お部屋の暖房をそろそろ切ろうかなと思います。ƪ(˘⌣˘)ʃ\n節約になるといいな〜\n節約といえば、電気はこまめに消すように心がけています!\nあと、最近スイッチ付きのコンセントにしました。\n節約大事☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の握手会でお誕生日が近かったので、沢山のお花を頂きました💐\nありがとうございます!!✨\nその半分のお写真を載せますね!\nいきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ赤なバラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX42S2345RKX8AZVZGW0D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nなんかバラって持つだけでオシャレだ🌹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちは丸いバラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX53JRC5Q6SGW5ZHNBA7D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">服も花もパステルだ。片手だけどりぼんポーズだよ🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドームみたいな花だ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX64F6TZQA2E2RT7MR201","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいちごケーキみたい🎂✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真と同じポーズ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX72W4BM9DNPEN21EQ6FH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">22歳も楽しむね✌︎(　˙-˙　)✌︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなから!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX83GA904X7YEXM2QP9BJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nパネルついてる🥚可愛い〜パネルとも写真を撮ったのでまた載せます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイス🍨"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNX92NYAD1VB89S2HMKY25","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n途中でなぜか笑っちゃった(笑)アイスの顔にじわりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコケーキ風🍫"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXA3X6HZ0REZ4G16AFKRX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n可愛いしお腹空く(*´﹃`*)\nななこハート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXB4SZS55A64RBB8HC5K9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nきょんこハート的な･･･🤔💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ溢れる1年に。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXC5GQW65EN3PYFRJ3375","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n一緒に幸せになろうね☘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXD5ABZ2GDK4MX35TSGRG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">なんで日本の国旗なの🇯🇵 "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコアイス🍧"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXE5YMZ9PNKQVS42XRPEZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n癒しと元気を与えられてら嬉しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、半分の祝花でした(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n本当に嬉しい!\n発表会でもこんな貰ったことない(笑)!\n人にこんなに思ってもらえることが貴重すぎて大事にしようとあらためて思いました🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、近いうちに お花② を更新します。\nしばしお待ちを･･･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}